  "fishing_pool": "dusty-river",
  "description": "The far northern plains are a wide, sunlit stretch of dry grass, low shrubs and red rock. A pond occupies the left middle ground, rimmed with stones and reeds. Dirt paths fork across the foreground, weaving around boulders and patches of flowers. Tall cactus-like plants rise on the right, with a small tree farther back. The horizon is lined with broad ochre mesas separated by a long open valley. The water offers a clear point of orientation among the otherwise similar grasses and rocks, while the branching tracks connect the foreground to the distant reaches of the plain.",
